{"title":"Career roadmap — Travel Consultant","role":"Travel Consultant","summary":"A Travel Consultant helps customers plan, customise, book, and manage travel. The role combines tourism knowledge, airline and hotel reservations, itinerary design, sales, customer service, travel documentation, supplier management, and travel technology.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Travel & Tourism / Aviation"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com graduate, the strongest employability combination is travel expertise + commercial skills + digital tools + customer relationship management."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Travel Executive / Travel Consultant; develop reservations, itinerary planning, ticketing, sales and customer-service skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Senior Travel Consultant / Corporate or International Travel Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Travel Manager / Product Manager / Travel Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Head of Travel / Travel Business Director / Travel Entrepreneur"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Travel & business foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism fundamentals"},{"text":"Travel industry structure"},{"text":"Tourism geography"},{"text":"Airline industry basics"},{"text":"Hospitality fundamentals"},{"text":"Travel economics"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Customer relationship management"},{"text":"Accounting and business finance"},{"text":"Travel documentation fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Professional email writing"},{"text":"Customer communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Create itineraries for 10 destinations"},{"text":"Compare airline and hotel options"},{"text":"Prepare a complete travel budget"},{"text":"Create a destination comparison dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Reservations & itinerary management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Air travel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Domestic/international flights"},{"text":"Fare classes"},{"text":"Baggage rules"},{"text":"Connecting flights"},{"text":"Flight schedules"},{"text":"Fare conditions"},{"text":"Cancellation/change policies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hotels"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Room categories"},{"text":"Meal plans"},{"text":"Hotel rates"},{"text":"Cancellation policies"},{"text":"Supplier comparison"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Travel documentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passport"},{"text":"Visa fundamentals"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Foreign exchange"},{"text":"Immigration requirements"},{"text":"Destination-specific documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Itinerary planning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Day-by-day schedules"},{"text":"Transfers"},{"text":"Attractions"},{"text":"Activities"},{"text":"Time zones"},{"text":"Travel buffers"},{"text":"Contingency planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS fundamentals"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Booking engines"},{"text":"OTA platforms"},{"text":"Travel management systems"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Build a complete 7-day international travel package with flights, hotel, transfers, activities, insurance, documentation checklist, pricing and profit margin."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Sales & specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel sales"},{"text":"Lead qualification"},{"text":"Customer profiling"},{"text":"Upselling"},{"text":"Cross-selling"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Supplier management"},{"text":"Group travel"},{"text":"Corporate travel"},{"text":"MICE"},{"text":"Luxury travel"},{"text":"International travel"},{"text":"Complaint resolution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop analytics skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"CRM reporting"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Revenue/margin analysis"},{"text":"Sales funnel analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project — Travel Business Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Enquiries","Quotes","Bookings","Revenue","Margin"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Average booking value"},{"text":"Repeat customers"},{"text":"Cancellation rate"},{"text":"Destination demand"},{"text":"Salesperson performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Become job-ready"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 2–3 substantial projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Travel Package Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Budget package"},{"text":"Family package"},{"text":"Honeymoon package"},{"text":"Corporate package"},{"text":"Luxury package"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include complete costing and margins."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Corporate Travel Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Employee request","Approval","Flight","Hotel","Transport","Expense","Reporting"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — AI Travel Planning Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"Prototype an assistant that generates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Destination suggestions"},{"text":"Itineraries"},{"text":"Budget estimates"},{"text":"Hotel categories"},{"text":"Activities"},{"text":"Travel checklists"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated travel information must be verified against current airline, hotel, visa and government requirements before being used commercially."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation",