pplier performance"},{"text":"Travel-policy compliance"},{"text":"Cost optimisation"},{"text":"Traveller safety"},{"text":"Carbon emissions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Sustainable Travel"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable tourism"},{"text":"Eco-tourism"},{"text":"Responsible tourism"},{"text":"Carbon-aware travel"},{"text":"Community-based tourism"},{"text":"Sustainable destination management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Luxury Personalisation"},{"type":"p","text":"High-value travel will increasingly require:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Private experiences"},{"text":"Premium accommodation"},{"text":"Personal concierge"},{"text":"Special-occasion planning"},{"text":"Exclusive destinations"},{"text":"Highly personalised itineraries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Travel Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Travel professionals will increasingly work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Booking engines"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Dynamic pricing"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"Customer-data platforms"},{"text":"Travel analytics"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the Travel Consultant role evolves"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search","Recommend","Book"]},{"type":"h","text":"Future model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand traveller","Predict preferences","Design experience","Optimise cost","Manage risk","Provide real-time support"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professionals will evolve from booking agents into travel experience strategists."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Destination management"},{"text":"Itinerary planning"},{"text":"Airline reservations"},{"text":"Hotel reservations"},{"text":"Tour operations"},{"text":"Travel documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Costing"},{"text":"Margin management"},{"text":"Supplier management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Booking systems"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"AI travel tools"},{"text":"Digital platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Consultation"},{"text":"Complaint handling"},{"text":"Relationship management"},{"text":"Personalisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel economics"},{"text":"Revenue management"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Business analytics"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Additional advantage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foreign languages"},{"text":"International destination expertise"},{"text":"MICE knowledge"},{"text":"Corporate travel management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tourism + geography + communication + Excel","Year 2: Reservations + GDS + itinerary planning","Year 3: Sales + corporate/luxury/MICE specialisation + analytics","Final Year: Travel portfolio + internship + industry certification","0–2 Years: Travel Executive / Consultant","2–5 Years: Senior Consultant / Destination Specialist","5–8 Years: Travel Manager / Product Manager","8–15 Years: Head of Travel / Business Director","15+ Years: Travel Business Leader / Entrepreneur"],"label":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Travel & Tourism","Travel Internship","GDS","Airline/Hotel Reservations","Itinerary Planning","Sales","Excel","CRM","Travel Documentation","Corporate/Luxury/MICE Specialisation","AI Travel Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Key principle","text":"A strong Travel Consultant is not merely a ticket or hotel booking agent. The valuable professional can understand traveller requirements, design practical experiences, optimise 